# Post-it notes

## Data model (`user_post_it_tasks`)

- Scoped: `user_id` + `room_id` (RLS: users see only own rows).
- Fields: `title`, `items` (JSONB `{ id, text, done }[]`), `pos_x/y`, `width/height`, `color`, `z_index`, `pinned`, `closed`, `title_done`.
- **Closed**: `closePostItTask` sets `closed`, `title_done`, all items `done`; hidden from canvas, listed in `RoomTodoPanel`. **Reopen** restores at saved position via `reopenPostItTask`.

