## UI behavior (do not regress)

- **Drag**: content uses `pointer-events-none` in view mode; document-level pointer listeners; direct DOM `left/top` updates while dragging.
- **Resize**: smooth drag (no step snap until release); border handles on hover; hide resize ring + toolbar while `dragging`.
- **Z-index**: use raw `task.zIndex` (no `Math.max(..., 10)`); optimistic `onFocus()` returns new z; persist with `updatePostItTask`.
- **Shadow**: background + shadow on same outer element; no extra 1px outline on active shadow.
- **Tooltips**: wrap icon buttons in `PostItIconTooltip` (instant CSS), not native `title`.
- **Edit**: double-click; title + bullet items; auto-shrink font via `use-post-it-fit-font.ts`.

## Adding features

1. Migration if new columns → mapper → shared type → `task-actions.ts` → UI.
2. Filter open notes: `tasks.filter(t => !t.closed)` for canvas; full list for todo panel.
3. Use `onTaskUpdate` / `onTaskFocus` on canvas when merging closed + open task state in stack.
